{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1211117001:0":{"text":"I can't believe we actually defeated Hodgkin!","source_cn":"我们打败了霍德希金……真不敢相信！我们居然打败了霍德希金！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0764621CF9F39C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211117002:0":{"text":"Wow... What a victory.","source_cn":"那可是率领着死潮舰队的大海盗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC5E53B3E3F8FE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211117003:0":{"text":"Sinbad, why didn't you tell us that Hodgkin could turn into a spirit?","source_cn":"辛巴达，你从来没说过霍德希金还能变成幽灵啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x628BEA38749AE184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211117004:0":{"text":"Huh? What?","source_cn":"啊？什么幽灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08A5AEE4C6F39471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211117005:0":{"text":"Wasn't the Hodgkin we just fought a spirit?","source_cn":"刚刚和我们战斗的霍德希金，不是个幽灵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E70923F9EB21882","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211117006:0":{"text":"He did look like a spirit!","source_cn":"应该说——长得像幽灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D234DC248D26404","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211117007:0":{"text":"Magister, did you notice anything unusual?","source_cn":"梅林！你发现了异常吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x70FC2AFE544C4D0E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, did you notice anything unusual?","female":"Magister, did you notice anything unusual?","variant_male_record_index":"130099","variant_female_record_index":"130100","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1211117007":{"text":"Magister, did you notice anything unusual?","source_cn":"梅林！你发现了异常吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x70FC2AFE544C4D0E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, did you notice anything unusual?","female":"Magister, did you notice anything unusual?","variant_male_record_index":"130099","variant_female_record_index":"130100","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211117008:0":{"text":"I'm confused. I think I saw Hodgkin himself.","source_cn":"我不懂你们在说什么，我看到的是霍德希金本人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC43F1B14F627945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"Sonja, what did you see?","source_cn":"索尼娅看到的是什么样子？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD66034C3D7C3E545","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sonja, what did you see?","female":"Sonja, what did you see?","variant_male_record_index":"65494","variant_female_record_index":"65495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211117009:0":{"text":"I saw what Chippy saw! Instead of a spirit, I think it was more like Hodgkin's phantom.","source_cn":"我和满满看到的一样。但我认为与其说是幽灵，应该把他称为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6942AAEF3D0D731B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"Hammie, what did you see?","source_cn":"漫漫看到的是什么样子？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD0D22DAD80F8E4CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hammie, what did you see?","female":"Hammie, what did you see?","variant_male_record_index":"65496","variant_female_record_index":"65497","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1211117010:0":{"text":"The three of us saw something different from the magister... Is it like what Hammie said? Do mages have the ability to see through illusions?","source_cn":"只有我们三个和梅林看到的不一样……难道就像漫漫说的，是...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x381D91790B280E51","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The three of us saw something different from the magister... Is it like what Hammie said? Do mages have the ability to see through illusions?","female":"The three of us saw something different from the magister... Is it like what Hammie said? Do mages have the ability to see through illusions?","variant_male_record_index":"130103","variant_female_record_index":"130104","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211117011:0":{"text":"Seriously, what is going on...?","source_cn":"这……到底是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56D943B14ABA3142","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1211117012:0":{"text":"As the magister regains more power, it makes sense that he can see through illusions and discern the truth.","source_cn":"按理说，主人寻回的力量越来越多了，确实可以看破幻象，洞...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6B69EF80CE3108EE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"As the magister regains more power, it makes sense that he can see through illusions and discern the truth.","female":"As the magister regains more power, it makes sense that she can see through illusions and discern the truth.","variant_male_record_index":"130106","variant_female_record_index":"130107","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1211117013:0":{"text":"Hodgkin's corpse disappeared too... and there are no traces of our fight anywhere.","source_cn":"霍德希金的尸体也消失了……周围好像也没留下打斗的痕迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC61D93A9AE042FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1211117014:0":{"text":"I swear I felt his hook slice through me... Was such a vivid battle really just an illusion?","source_cn":"我明明能感觉到他的勾手划过身体……那么真实的战斗，竟然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E1FBAE0AFCF20B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1211117015:0":{"text":"It takes incredible power to conjure an illusion this realistic...","source_cn":"想要营造如此真实的幻觉，需要非常强大的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037C46C4F4839881","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1211117015":{"text":"It takes incredible power to conjure an illusion this realistic...","source_cn":"想要营造如此真实的幻觉，需要非常强大的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037C46C4F4839881","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1211117016:0":{"text":"If Tasi is the one behind all these, she must be something special...","source_cn":"要是塔西能做到这种事……她的身份一定不简单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF824585C8D2943D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1211117018:0":{"text":"Arrrghh! I can't wrap my head around this! Let's just grab the treasure and get the heck out of this cursed place!","source_cn":"啊啊啊——想不明白！早点拿到宝藏，早点离开这个鬼地方吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2AE0895108C699A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"It must be Tasi's doing.","source_cn":"是塔西干的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BFB9248A0549A45","variant_s